<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle weak-off $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle weak-off $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers under 500 lbs. 2.00-4.00 higher, over 500 lbs. weak to 2.00 lower in Thursday's National Stockyards auction.</p>
<p>Feeder heifers under 500 lbs. 1.00-2.00 higher, over 500 lbs. weak to 2.00 lower. Overall quality compable  to last week's level. Large buyer attendance.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 49.00-54.00</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 50.00-55.00, Part load 620 lbs. Crossbreds 57.75.</p>
<p>700-800 lbs. 50.00-55.00</p>
<p>600-1000 lbs. 45.00-51.00</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 44.00-49.00</p>
<p>600-800 lbs. 47.00-50.00</p>
<p>Fleshy:  700-850 lbs. 35.00-40.00</p>
<p>Receipts 450    Last week 550  Last Year 425</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
